  "notes": {
    "raw": "\\*Data above 298 K estimated. \nPhase change: 1633 K, $\\alpha - \\beta$ transition point of Th; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0.860$ kcal/mol. \nHeat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations: \n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 2 0 0 0 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\mathrm{Cp} ^ {\\circ} = 1 7. 4 1 7 + 1. 6 1 4 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 0. 9 7 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {5} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 2} \\\\ \\mathrm{H} ^ {\\circ} - \\mathrm{H} _ {2 9 8} ^ {\\circ} = 1 7. 4 1 7 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 0. 8 0 7 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 0. 9 7 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {2} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 5. 5 9 2 \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\nReaction equations (kcal/mol): \n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 1 6 3 3 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\Delta \\mathrm{Hr} ^ {\\circ} = - 1 8 1. 6 4 0 + 3. 0 1 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 0. 4 6 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 2 1. 4 0 0 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} \\\\ \\Delta G r ^ {\\circ} = - 1 8 1. 6 4 0 - 3. 0 1 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{TlnT} + 0. 4 6 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 1 0. 7 0 0 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} + 6 4. 3 1 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} \\\\ 1 6 3 3 - 2 0 0 0 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\Delta \\mathrm{Hr} ^ {\\circ} = - 1 8 4. 8 8 9 + 5. 2 6 5 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 0. 9 3 1 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} - 2 4. 2 0 0 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} \\\\ \\Delta G r ^ {\\circ} = - 1 8 4. 8 8 9 - 5. 2 6 5 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{TlnT} + 0. 9 3 1 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} - 1 2. 1 0 0 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} + 8 2. 1 7 9 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\nSource: Data from Gronvold (47) who estimated all above 298 K. ",
    "lines_raw": [
      "\\*Data above 298 K estimated.",
      "Phase change: 1633 K, $\\alpha - \\beta$ transition point of Th; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0.860$ kcal/mol.",
